==Trivia==

* Jax's eyes are blue.
* Jax was likely inspired by {{wikia|shannara|Garet Jax}}, "The Weapons Master" of the ''Sword of Shannara Trilogy''. He was adept with any weapon and was undefeated in combat, though he often wielded a sword and cudgel.
* In the [[April Fool's Patch 2011|V1.0.0.115]] ([[April Fools' Day]]) patch, {{ii|Wriggle's Lantern}} was given the following joke passive, referencing {{cis|Jax}} usage of a lamp post (which is functionally similar to a lantern) as a weapon:
** New {{sbc|Unique Passive}}: Taunts nearby {{ci|Jax|Jaxes}} (both enemy and allied).
* In the now-removed official League of Legends [https://web.archive.org/web/20130726165848/http://forums.na.leagueoflegends.com/board/ forums], the [[:File:Jax_Relentless_Assault_old.png|original icon]] of {{ai|Relentless Assault|Jax|image=Jax Relentless Assault old.png}} was used to represent the "Off Topic Discussion" section.
* The old icon art of {{ai|Grandmaster's Might|Jax}} features a stunned soldier who was directly mirrored from the [[:File:Time_Bomb_old.png|original icon]] for {{ai|Time Bomb|Zilean|image=Time Bomb old.png}}.
* {{cai|Grandmaster-at-Arms|Jax}}, {{cai|The Darkin Blade|Aatrox}}, {{cai|Spider Queen|Elise}}, {{cai|Fury of the North|Sejuani}}, {{cai|Night Hunter|Vayne}}, and {{cai|The Relentless Storm|Volibear}} are the only abilities in ''League of Legends'' that have the same name as their champion's title.
* Jax's Series 2 [[Eternals]] make the following references:
** ''	Active: Jax enters Evasion...'' is a reference to his ability description for {{ai|Counter Strike|Jax}}.

