==Trivia==

*The name ''Karthus'' resembles Medieval Latin {{w|Carthusian Order|Carthusianus}}.
;{{ci|Karthus|variant=old|image=Karthus OriginalSquare old.png|border=true|size=32|Karthus, the Deathsinger}}
* Karthus is [[Voice cast (League of Legends)|voiced]] by {{w|Adam_Harrington_(voice_actor)|Adam Harrington}}, who also voices {{ci|Kassadin}}, {{ci|Mordekaiser}}, {{ci|Ryze|variant=old2|Ryze, the Rogue Mage}}, and {{ci|Shaco}}.
* During development he was called ''Lich''.
* {{cci|Requiem old.png|Karthus/History|Requiem}} was likely named after [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZZZ2bQzDxO4 Requiem Mass] referencing Karthus' singing for/about the dead.
* His {{csl|Karthus|Original|variant=Ch|link=Karthus/History|image=Karthus OriginalSquare old.png|Chinese Classic splash art}} made a [http://i.imgur.com/SZg7N.jpg cameo] in {{w|Fright Night (2011 film)|Fright Night}} along with {{csl|Fiddlesticks|Original|variant=old|image=Fiddlesticks_OriginalSquare old.png}}.

;{{ci|Karthus|size=32|Karthus, the Deathsinger}}
* A glass case reading {{sbc|'Press {{ai|Requiem|Karthus|R}} to Win'}} can be seen in the game's Mac Version launch trailer.
* Before 2016, Karthus had been disabled for every single [[Ultra Rapid Fire]] edition (most likely to prevent 'Spam {{ai|Requiem|Karthus|R}} to Win' abuse cases).
* For a brief time in [[Season 2015]], Karthus had a bug where he could remain in {{ai|Death Defied|Karthus}} indefinitely while alive and held an 87% win rate.<ref>[https://twitter.com/RiotFeralPony/status/1184155872370536449 FeralPony on God Karthus]</ref>


