==Trivia==

* Jarvan IV was first mentioned in {{cis|Urgot|variant=old}} old lore.
* A tab for Jarvan IV can be faintly seen at the top during {{cis|Maokai}} [[Art Spotlight]].
* In-universe Demacian naming convention does not mirror real-life's European royalty and nobility's naming convention; as the current Jarvan should not have gotten the {{w|regnal number}} '''''IV''''' before his coronation.
* The terrain created by {{ai|Cataclysm|Jarvan IV}} is made of 24 minions to make sure that no one can squeeze through the wall.<ref>[https://engineering.riotgames.com/news/taxonomy-tech-debt LtRandolph talking about engineering]</ref>
