* Kha'Zix's production name was 'Teek'.<ref>[https://web.archive.org/web/0/http://na.leagueoflegends.com/board/showthread.php?p=29383270#29383270 Phreak on Kha'Zix]</ref>
* [[Ryan 'Morello' Scott]] stated Kha'Zix is completely unrelated to canceled champion {{ui|Omen}}.<ref>[https://web.archive.org/web/0/http://na.leagueoflegends.com/board/showthread.php?p=29384332#29384332 Morello on Kha'Zix]</ref>
* Kha'Zix was the last champion to feature an '[[Art Spotlight]]'.
* When concealing himself (using {{ai|Void Assault|Kha'Zix}}) Kha'Zix will run in a different manner than usual.
* When acquiring {{ai|Evolved Wings|Kha'Zix}}, Kha'Zix will fly for a few seconds while moving ({{csl|Ezreal|Pulsefire}} and {{csl|Kog'Maw|Monarch}} do the same).
* [[The Hunt is On!]] between Kha'Zix and {{ci|Rengar}} references {{w|Alien vs Predator}}.
* {{ai|Taste Their Fear|Kha'Zix|Isolation}} references {{w|Alien (franchise)|Alien}} (Kha'Zix's main inspiration).
* Being an arthropodic invader from another world with scythes as his primary weapon, he also bears a striking resemblance to the real-life {{w|mantis}} & [http://metroid.wikia.com/wiki/Space_Pirate Metroid's Space Pirates], though he also possesses beetles' hardened outer wings.
* {{ais|Void Spike|Kha'Zix}} projectiles might be referencing a {{wikia|StarCraft|Hydralisk|Hydralisk's}} from {{w|StarCraft}}.
* Kha'Zix can spend evolution points on abilities he has not learned yet (doing this only benefits {{ai|Taste Their Fear|Kha'Zix}} for the bonus range on basic attacks).
** Kha'Zix must spend evolution points before ranking up any ability if he has any unspent points after ranking up {{ai|Void Assault|Kha'Zix}}.
* Kha'Zix is the only Voidborn champion without an ability that deals true damage (unlike {{ai|Endless Banquet|Bel'Veth}}, {{ai|Feast|Cho'Gath}}, {{ai|Furious Bite|Rek'Sai}}, {{ai|Icathian Surprise|Kog'Maw}}, {{ai|Organic Deconstruction|Vel'Koz}}, and {{ai|Life Form Disintegration Ray|Vel'Koz}}).
* Kha'Zix's name means "You face yourself" in an old mortal language, possibly Shuriman or Ixtalian.
* Kha'Zix had his game assets reused for several [[featured game mode]]s.
** He was given a retexture and features as a monster called the "Jumpy Slashy Monster" in {{tip|Invasion}}.
** His animations were reused for the {{ui|Kha'Zix|file=ShimmerstrikerSquare.png|Shimmerstriker|link=Odyssey: Extraction#Map elements}} monster in {{tip|Odyssey: Extraction}}.

