==Trivia==
* {{Shapeshifter Champion|Kled}}
** In Kled's case, {{ai|Skaarl the Cowardly Lizard|Kled}} allows him to switch between his {{sbc|Mounted}} and {{sbc|Dismounted}} forms.
* {{Champion without ability power ratio|Kled}}
* Kled and '''{{ui|Skaarl|nolink=true}}''' are the first champion with two health bars, combining to form the highest in-game base health, with Kled's being the lowest.
** Kled is also the first champion and one of the two champions in the game whose health cannot be improved except through growth per level, the second being {{ci|Pyke}}.
* Kled, while {{ai|Skaarl the Cowardly Lizard 2|Kled|dismounted}}, has the lowest base [[movement speed]] of all champions at {{ccd|Kled|ms}}.
* When using the joke emote, Kled will randomly play one of two joke animations.
* {{ai|Chaaaaaaaarge!!!|Kled|Mr. Kled's Wild Ride}} is most likely a reference to the Disneyland attraction {{fandom|disney|Mr. Toad's Wild Ride}} from the animated film {{fandom|disney|The Adventures of Ichabod and Mr. Toad}}, originally adapted from the children's novel {{fandom|disney|The Wind in the Willows}} by Kenneth Grahame.
** Kled and '''{{ui|Skaarl|nolink=true}}''', as {{fandom|disney|J._Thaddeus_Toad|Mr. Toad}} and {{fandom|disney|Cyril_Proudbottom|Cyril the Horse}} respectively. 
*** [https://vignette.wikia.nocookie.net/disney/images/b/bb/Toad%2BCyril.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20140912121802 J. Thaddeus Toad And Cyril Proudbottom] 
* {{ai|Chaaaaaaaarge!!!|Kled|Mr. Kled's Wild Ride}} is a probable reference to "[https://knowyourmeme.com/memes/mr-bones-wild-ride MR BONES WILD RIDE]", a custom roller coaster built in [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/RollerCoaster_Tycoon_2 RollerCoaster Tycoon 2] called  that took in game years to complete its course. Then, once a passenger finally got off the ride, it led back to the start of the ride, creating an never-ending cycle of riding the attraction. One of the most famous quotes that a ton of riders thought was "I want to get off 'MR BONES WILD RIDE'".
* The name {{ai|Skaarl the Cowardly Lizard|Kled}} may be a reference to the ''{{w|Courage the Cowardly Dog}}'' {{w|Cartoon Network}} cartoon.
* Kled is the first champion to swear (albeit censored) in-game.
* Kled is the only champion to celebrate takedowns with a unique animation.
* Kled's {{ai|Skaarl the Cowardly Lizard 2|Kled|dismounted}} dance references the {{w|Moonwalk_(dance)|Moonwalk}}, a famous [https://youtu.be/b6pomaq30Gg?t=48 dance move].
** A side-by-side comparison can be seen [https://youtu.be/E85m7JGhhR8?t=61 here.]
* The song used in the short cinematic [[The Reunion]] is {{w|Edvard Grieg|Edvard Grieg's}}, [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzTQ9fjforY Peer Gynt - Morning Mood].
* While out of combat, '''Skaarl''' will tilt her head to look at nearby visible jungle monsters.

